{"id":"wwnejjuvemlyzzchyc330lylu","title":"Asahi Linux 从 MIT 许可证切换到 GPL 许可证","originalTitle":null,"summary":"Asahi Linux 项目宣布将 MIT 许可证升级为 GPLv2 或更高版本，以应对有人利用 AI 重写代码窃取成果的问题。MIT 许可证的宽松性曾导致开发者分支代码被未标注出处地发布甚至AI改写，引发项目方维权需求。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"奇客 Solidot"},"links":{"original":"https://www.solidot.org/story?sid=85832"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T06:29:20.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T10:31:32.648Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T10:31:32.648Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":52,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"23970eb0-8b93-40ab-8470-26040feb6a51","title":"Asahi Linux切换许可证以应对AI改写窃取成果"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"23970eb0-8b93-40ab-8470-26040feb6a51","title":"Asahi Linux切换许可证以应对AI改写窃取成果"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fzC4I0776KLg","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}